@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — design evaluation record
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Exact required outcome / source / affected gate" as Goal
rectangle "Accepted constraints + proposed detail + unknowns\nTechnical / economic / operating / applicability / schedule criteria" as Criteria
rectangle "Compare actual candidate options with evidence\nSupport, conflicts, limits, maintenance and change impact" as Compare
rectangle "Actual scoped decision record when made\nOption / rationale / evidence / consequences / remaining gate" as Decision #DFF1EA
Goal --> Criteria
Criteria --> Compare
Compare --> Decision
Compare ..> Criteria : unresolved assumption or conflict
note bottom of Decision
Twelve questions are prepared; no option selected by this analysis.
No familiar demo tool, cost guess or passed render chooses architecture.
Material scope/spending/commitment changes require actual disposition.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
